* ============================================================================
* 00_install_packages.do — One-shot ssc install for benefit_society
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* Per audit F-R10-L2 / F-R6-L1, install all third-party Stata packages
* required by the dual-track replication battery.
*
* Run ONCE per Stata installation:
*   . do 00_install_packages.do
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all

display _newline "[ssc install] benefit_society dual-track dependencies"
display      "================================================================"

* Core regression / fixed effects
capture which reghdfe
if _rc ssc install reghdfe, replace
capture which ftools
if _rc ssc install ftools, replace

* IV / 2SLS
capture which ivreg2
if _rc ssc install ivreg2, replace
capture which ranktest
if _rc ssc install ranktest, replace

* esttab / estout
capture which estout
if _rc ssc install estout, replace

* coefplot
capture which coefplot
if _rc ssc install coefplot, replace

* Winsorization
capture which winsor2
if _rc ssc install winsor2, replace

* Wild cluster bootstrap (F-R5-H1 / F-H4)
capture which boottest
if _rc ssc install boottest, replace

* Family-wise Romano-Wolf (F-R5-M2)
capture which rwolf
if _rc ssc install rwolf, replace

* Kappa with CI (article-level inter-track agreement, F-M2)
capture which kapci2
if _rc ssc install kapci2, replace

display _newline "[OK] ssc install complete. Cross-platform note: macOS / Linux users " ///
                 "may need separate `net install` for kapci2 if SSC mirror differs." ///
                 " See README.md (F-R11-L1)."
